identifying, for each received event indicator, an event type associated therewith;
extracting event data from the received event indicator based on the identified event type;
selecting an event message template from a plurality of predefined event message templates, wherein the selection is based on the identified event type;
populating the selected event message template with the extracted event data to form a customized event message;
generating the customized event message;
and transmitting the customized event message to a designated recipient.

