an actuation mechanism coupled to the nanotube resonator, the actuation mechanism configured to induce mechanical oscillation of the nanotube resonator; and
a detection mechanism coupled to the nanotube resonator, the detection mechanism configured to detect mechanical oscillation of the nanotube resonator and generate an electrical output signal representative of said mechanical oscillation.

