adaptively adjusting, by the wireless communication device, at least one communication parameter for subsequent transmissions over the wireless communication channel based on the determined at least one characteristic of communication errors; and
transmitting, by the wireless communication device, subsequent data units over the wireless communication channel using the adjusted at least one communication parameter to reduce communication errors.

