    generating said encoded bitstream, wherein said encoded bitstream comprises information indicative of said selected encoding transformation scheme;
    and, at a decoder, receiving said encoded bitstream;
    extracting said information indicative of said selected encoding transformation scheme from said encoded bitstream;
    adaptively selecting a decoding transformation scheme corresponding to said extracted information;
    applying said selected decoding transformation scheme to decode said encoded bitstream into a reconstructed series of pictures;
    and outputting said reconstructed series of pictures.

