identifying, by the wireless communication device, one or more characteristics of communication errors based on the obtained feedback information;
dynamically modifying, by the wireless communication device, at least one communication parameter for subsequent transmissions over the wireless communication channel based on the identified one or more characteristics of communication errors; and
sending, by the wireless communication device, subsequent data units over the wireless communication channel utilizing the modified at least one communication parameter to diminish communication errors.

A road construction machine, comprising:
