an archival storage module configured to retain the processed database log data and the generated archival metadata in an archival storage system; and
a retrieval module operatively coupled to the archival storage module, the retrieval module configured to accept a retrieval request for particular database log data and, by employing the generated archival metadata, retrieve the particular database log data from the archival storage system.

